# Shaders keep \n line ends in every checkout: vs-gyroflow builds them in (include_str!) and finds their sections by
# their \n (gpu_table.rs), and Git for Windows' core.autocrlf (GitHub's Windows runners have it too) would otherwise
# write them with \r\n
*.glsl text eol=lf
*.glsl.in text eol=lf
*.wgsl text eol=lf
